  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Download map tiles onto your phone so the map keeps working with no signal.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Maps & Favorites",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the <strong>Maps &#x26; Favorites</strong> icon.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>It has three tabs: <strong>Imagery</strong>, <strong>Mobile</strong> and <strong>FAVS</strong> (favourites).</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0eaa4d299fd7efcd.webp",
              "width": 189,
              "height": 126
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Mark the area to download",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On the <strong>Mobile</strong> tab toggle to <strong>Online</strong>, then tap <strong>Select Area</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pick <strong>Rectangle</strong>, <strong>Free Form</strong>, <strong>Lasso</strong> or <strong>Map Select</strong> and draw your region.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/95fa01e8259285c0.webp",
              "width": 367,
              "height": 170
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set the resolution",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Drag the slider ends to set detail — <strong>coarse</strong> for fewer tiles, <strong>fine</strong> for sharper maps.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ATAK shows the tile count; the limit is 850,000 tiles per download.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/bb7aba1816fd05a0.webp",
              "width": 220,
              "height": 100
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name it and download",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Download</strong>, name the tileset and tap <strong>OK</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A progress bar appears; <strong>Cancel</strong> stops it.</li>\n<li>You can also add tiles to an existing set or save an overlay.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/233202f64b766362.webp",
              "width": 220,
              "height": 145
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Switch to your offline maps",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Toggle to <strong>Local</strong> to list your downloaded layers, nearest first. Tap one to use it as the map source — the map now works with no signal.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/95d8e7d780f95ad1.webp",
              "width": 196,
              "height": 181
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Manage and share imagery",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The <strong>Imagery</strong> tab lists all your maps.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Expand a category to <strong>Send</strong> a layer to other users or delete it.</li>\n<li>The <strong>Outline</strong> checkbox shows each layer's border.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6a7e67ec50bffd9c.webp",
              "width": 245,
              "height": 192
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Bookmark a view",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On <strong>FAVS</strong>, tap <strong>Add Current View</strong> to save your spot and its imagery. Tap a saved view to jump back, or <strong>Send</strong> it to share with your unit.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6012d9b47815dff7.webp",
              "width": 203,
              "height": 188
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
